// A `source` target without `lang` and without `platform` has one E1104, for `lang`, in every command: whether
// `platform` is needed depends on the `lang` (`"c"` needs it, `"js"` does not), which is not known (§15.3,
// §18.1; R-47, S-824, S-827).

pub fn f() -> I32 { 1 }
